          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When an individual or a nation or a community are corrupted beyond, to the point of no reform,",
      "start": 1850.891,
      "end": 1859.09,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
